1
00:00:14,679 --> 00:00:15,359
Commander!

2
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:17,239
The Japanese breached the Min River line,

3
00:00:17,359 --> 00:00:19,039
and landed on Jiadeng and Langqi islands!

4
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:19,960
Commander!

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,679
The Japanese took Changle and Lianjiang!

6
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,839
Excuse me, sorry!

7
00:00:29,839 --> 00:00:31,160
Hurry, hurry! Run!

8
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,280
Brother Mingyuan!

9
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,520
I'd like to introduce you to someone.

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,200
On the morning of April 21, 1941,

11
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:15,480
over 20 Japanese warplanes

12
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:18,239
bombed Chinese positions on the left bank

13
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,799
of the Min River in relentless runs.

14
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,200
The Japanese advanced on several fronts,

15
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,200
encircling Rongcheng.

16
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,719
On the afternoon of April 21,

17
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,159
the Japanese fully occupied Rongcheng.

18
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:32,239
Rongcheng fell for the first time.

19
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:35,519
Let go of me!

20
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Stop resisting!

21
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,439
Surrender now!

22
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,799
Stop resisting!

23
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,359
Surrender now!

24
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:52,640
Stop resisting!

25
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,200
Surrender now!

26
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:55,400
Let go! Let go!

27
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,159
Come on, Mom.

28
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:03,599
Hurry!

29
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,439
Keep moving! Run!

30
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,000
Hurry, hurry!

31
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,080
Dad! Dad!

32
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:13,919
Dad!

33
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,800
You go first! I'll hold them off!

34
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,680
I'm going with you!

35
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,680
Be careful!

36
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,439
Dayong! Mom!

37
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,199
Get out of here!

38
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,319
Hurry, run! Go find my brother!

39
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,680
Quick, go!

40
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:24,000
Son, please be careful!

41
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,240
Wanting!

42
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,080
After the Japanese captured Rongcheng,

43
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,879
they set up checkpoints on every street,

44
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,840
mounted machine guns,

45
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,800
and put it under heavy guard.

46
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,840
We're trapped here now.

47
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,080
Trying to break out of here

48
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,039
is next to impossible.

49
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,560
But if we contact our troops,

50
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,560
and strike from inside and out,

51
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:38,080
there's a glimmer of hope.

52
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,879
But Japanese warplanes bombed Rongcheng,

53
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,280
and our liaison station was destroyed.

54
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:44,080
The radio to contact HQ is lost as well.

55
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:45,960
A backup radio is hidden somewhere else.

56
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,120
Where?

57
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,319
Wenshan Girls' School.

58
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:51,240
Feng Xiaozhu is our liaison.

59
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,879
She hid the spare radio in a storage room.

60
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,479
Then let's find a way

61
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,680
to sneak inside.

62
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:59,280
Then we need to devise a meticulous plan.

63
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:01,759
Come on.

64
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,360
Careful, take it easy.

65
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:09,919
How is everyone?

66
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:12,240
I disinfected their wounds with alcohol.

67
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,719
I'm not a licensed doctor,

68
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,560
just a coroner.

69
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,919
If we truly want to heal them,

70
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,079
besides food and warmth to build immunity,

71
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,480
we also need proper medication.

72
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,360
But right now,

73
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,600
food is scarce, and there's no medicine.

74
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,480
I don't know what else to do.

75
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:24,959
Do your best to treat them.

76
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,600
I'll figure something out.

77
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:26,399
All right.

78
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,319
The wounded are piling up,

79
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,600
and more refugees keep arriving.

80
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:35,079
There's not enough food or medicine.

81
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,120
In that case,

82
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:37,959
Tomorrow I'll take the Sanshan Gang men

83
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:38,800
into the city

84
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,240
and smuggle some supplies back.

85
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,759
Everyone, please stay calm.

86
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:45,279
The supply delivery will be here shortly.

87
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,879
Captain Xu.

88
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:49,680
I've brought everything you asked for.

89
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,319
Dad!

90
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,079
Son!

91
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,040
How did you end up here?

92
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:58,360
I've finally found you again.

93
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:00,279
Let me look at you.

94
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:02,439
You've gotten thinner.

95
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,879
Didn't you board the ship?

96
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,199
I did board it.

97
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,839
But when the ship reached Mawei Port,

98
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,199
the Japanese ambushed us.

99
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:11,399
By chance, I boarded a rescue boat

100
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:12,360
and came back to Rongcheng.

101
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,759
I was going to look for you,

102
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,240
but ran into Japanese soldiers again.

103
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,279
Luckily, the guerrillas saved me.

104
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,519
To return the favor,

105
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,240
I agreed to supply them with provisions.

106
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,600
As long as you're safe.

107
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,680
It's all thanks to Captain Xu.

108
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,720
If not for him,

109
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,360
I wouldn't be seeing you right now.

110
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,560
You have no idea...

111
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,879
When the Japanese bombed Rongcheng,

112
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:33,199
I was terrified half to death.

113
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,800
I thought I'd never see you again.

114
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,839
Now seeing that you're all safe,

115
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,720
I'm so relieved.

116
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,800
Dali!

117
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,600
Dali!

118
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:46,279
Dali!

119
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,879
Get a doctor! Village Chief, what's wrong?

120
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:49,600
Many villagers have been wounded!

121
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,199
Quick, get them to the medical area!

122
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,079
Right!

123
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,240
Mother, where's Dayong?

124
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,879
Why didn't he come with you?

125
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:59,199
Dayong and Wanting tried to protect us,

126
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,480
and the Japanese devils...

127
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:13,800
Dali,

128
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,600
take the village chief and your mother

129
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,319
somewhere to rest first.

130
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,399
Refugees keep pouring into the shelter.

131
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,079
We need to contact HQ as soon as possible.

132
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,000
Otherwise, we won't last much longer.

133
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:32,439
I'll go to Wenshan Girls' School
to find the backup radio.

134
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,680
I'm coming with you.

135
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:35,000
All right. Stay safe.

136
00:06:54,279 --> 00:06:55,160
Surrender.

137
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,680
Never.

138
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:12,680
You...

139
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:14,319
Surrender.

140
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,680
Never.

141
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,800
All of you...

142
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,040
Surrender.

143
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:45,319
Well done. Good kid.

144
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,879
Who are you?

145
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,680
What are you doing here?

146
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:21,160
We're cooks under Colonel Tanaka.

147
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,360
Here to get seasonings from the kitchen.

148
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,519
Show me your papers.

149
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,200
All right.

150
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:41,799
Come in.

151
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,080
Found it.

152
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,799
That's great!

153
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:30,480
With this,

154
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,759
the people of Rongcheng can be saved.

155
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,480
But how

156
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,919
can we get it out of here?

157
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:45,840
Listen, I'll go find a cargo crate.

158
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:03,399
Don't kill me! Don't kill me! Don't—

159
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,759
We're Chinese!

160
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,600
Ch-Chinese.

161
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,120
Get up.

162
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,080
Who are you?

163
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,360
I... I'm a local cook.

164
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:18,879
He's a porter.

165
00:10:18,879 --> 00:10:19,320
Yeah.

166
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:21,039
How did you end up here?

167
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:22,720
The Japanese bombed Rongcheng,

168
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,720
and outside, Japanese are everywhere.

169
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,279
By pure chance, we ended up hiding here,

170
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,759
too afraid to go outside.

171
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,279
When hungry, we steal from the kitchen,

172
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,879
just barely scraping by.

173
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:36,360
We can't leave them here.

174
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:37,919
Once the Japanese find them,

175
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:40,639
they'll be killed.

176
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,519
Do you have a truck here?

177
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,360
Yes.

178
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:48,799
We do.

179
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,480
Do you have vinegar?

180
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,519
We have that too.

181
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:08,200
It's me, brother.

182
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:11,919
Just getting some seasonings...

183
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,840
does that really require a truck?

184
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,679
We saw a lot more good stuff.

185
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:20,360
Might as well take it,

186
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,840
so we don't have to make extra trips.

187
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,000
I need to inspect it.

188
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:46,679
What's that smell?

189
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:50,120
It's Colonel Tanaka's favorite vinegar.

190
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:58,000
Take a sniff. He loves it.

191
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,240
That's enough. Move along.

192
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,679
Thanks for your trouble.

193
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:23,360
Someone's in the back! Stop him!

194
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:34,639
Lian Ye
